  "body": "Mesmerising coastal views are enjoyed from every vantage point!\r\n\r\nSpaciously designed to capture the essence of private relaxed family living, the thoughtful mix of both entertaining and family independence options are here to be enjoyed. \r\n\r\nThis home and property exude a light-filled sense of freedom from the moment you venture up the gated driveway. Privacy is enjoyed as a premium, with a scenic panorama of coastal views, including Browns Island, Musick Point, and stretching across the Motukorea Channel as far as the eye can see.\r\n\r\nSpacious living areas unfold from the moment you enter through the front door, with open plan living and entertaining spaces flowing seamlessly to the outside lawn. The kitchen provides the ideal central hub to a happy family life, with ease of al fresco dining on the large outdoor patio area, flat lawn, or poolside.\r\n\r\nFlexible family or guest living is offered, with five bedrooms and an office – all enjoying the views, and parking is at a premium with both a double garage plus a separate single garage, ideal for that special sports car, jet skis, or other hobbies. \r\n\r\nPositioned on an easy care 897sqm site, with Churchill Park Reserve across the road, and a short few minutes’ walk to Karaka Bay beach, this home is perfectly located to access popular local schools, with convenient public transport to desired private schools, St Heliers shopping village and the waterfront boulevard. Auckland CBD is a picturesque drive along Tamaki Drive.\r\n\r\nA prized opportunity - in a tightly held community!",
